OL,5,G0510 Attenborough's Natural Curiosities
OL,6,     FStretched To The Limit: Sir David
OL,7,     FAttenborough looks at some amazing
OL,8,     Fquirks of evolution. This time, we
OL,9,     Ffocus on the giraffe's neck and
OL,10,     Fthe chameleon's tongue.
OL,11,G0535 Attenborough's Natural Curiosities
OL,12,     FA Curious Hoax?: The great Sir
OL,13,     FDavid Attenborough reveals
OL,14,     Fnature's evolutionary anomalies.
OL,15,     FHere he looks at the platypus and
OL,16,     Fthe curious case of the male
OL,17,     Fmidwife toad.
OL,23,VpppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG10/10
